p) or year."},{"q":"Can I find a wrestler's matches?","a":"Yes. Player pages list each wrestler's tournaments, results and related videos."},{"q":"Where do the tournament results come from?","a":"The 6,598 tournament results on player pages are taken from published documents: 3,687 from the Japan Wrestling Federation's historical records (compiled by Wrestling Spirits), 2,439 from lists of medalists (PDF) published on the Japan Wrestling Federation website (japan-wrestling.jp), 471 from final result books (PDF) of United World Wrestling (UWW) and 1 from other sources. Each result has a Source link that opens the original document. We do not make player pages for minors (including wrestlers not yet confirmed to be adults). If you find a mistake, please let us know through the contact form."},{"q":"Can I use the photos? I want a photo removed","a":"Photos are published with the photographers' permission, and the copyright belongs to them. Please ask the photographer before using a photo. To request a removal, use the contact form and choose Photos (removal request)."},{"q":"How do I report a mistake or ask to list or hide a video?","a":"Please use the contact form. We will review it and respond."},{"q":"How often is the site updated?","a":"Every day at around 6:00 a.m. Japan time, new YouTube videos are added and the pages are rebuilt automatically."},{"q":"Is there a Japanese version?","a":"Yes. Every page has a Japanese version at the same address without /en/. English pages show tournament and venue names in English; video titles stay in Japanese as originally published."}],"syn":[["東日本学生選手権（秋季大会）","東日本学生秋季選手権","東日本学生選手権秋季大会","東日本学生秋季新人選手権"],["東日本学生リーグ戦","東日本学生レスリングリーグ戦","東日本リーグ戦","東日本レスリング連盟リーグ戦"],["東日本学生選手権（春季大会）","東日本学生春季選手権","東日本学生選手権春季大会","東日本学生春季新人選手権","東日本学生春季女子選手権"],["東日本大学女子リーグ戦","東日本女子リーグ戦","東日本女子大学リーグ戦"],["全国高校生グレコローマン選手権","全国高校生グレコローマンレスリング選手権大会"],["全国高校選抜大会","全国高等学校選抜レスリング大会","風間杯全国高校選抜大会"],["全日本学生選手権（インカレ）","インカレ","全日本学生選手権","全日本学生レスリング選手権大会","H26年度全日